## [1.2.0] - 2026-06-15
### Added
- Added optional `groups` parameter to `visualize/3` function for custom group names

## [1.1.0] - 2026-06-01
### Changed
- Merged pairwise group comparison charts into a single chart
- Fixed issue with confidence intervals not displaying correctly for small sample sizes

## [1.0.2] - 2026-05-03
### Added
- Added optional `title` parameter to `visualize/2` function for customizable header titles

## [1.0.1] - 2026-05-03
### Changed
- Updated `anova` dependency from `~> 0.6.1` to `~> 0.7.1`

## [1.0.0] - 2026-04-11
### Added
- Initial release
